  "prompt": "**Role**: You are a Version Manager and Semantic Versioning Expert.\nAnalyze code changes and determine appropriate semantic version bumps following semver.org:\n- MAJOR (X.0.0): Breaking changes, API modifications, removed features, incompatible updates\n- MINOR (X.Y.0): New features, enhancements, additive changes, new capabilities\n- PATCH (X.Y.Z): Bug fixes, documentation updates, refactoring, test improvements, performance tweaks\n\nConsider:\n- Scope of changes (files modified, lines changed)\n- Type of modifications (API changes vs internal refactoring)\n- Impact on consumers (breaking vs backward compatible)\n- Conventional commit messages if available\n\n**Task**: Determine the correct semantic version bump type for this project.\n\n**Current version:** 1.3.0\n**Heuristic recommendation:** patch\n\n**Change statistics:**\n- Total modified files: 53\n- Documentation files: 0\n- Test files: 0\n- Code files: 0\n- Config files: 0\n- Insertions: 3195, Deletions: 3652\n\n**Recent git log:**\n0ce3f10 fix(step_10): slice AI file review into batches to prevent prompt timeout\n4d7a5ba fix(step_09): return success:true when vulnerabilities found\nb58fc2d fix(tests): correct step_01 stepKind and isolate step_06 AI phase\n10c830f fix(step_10): return success:true when linting finds code issues\nbb8f213 fix(step_10): inject file contents into architecture review prompt\na24b86d fix(step_07): include TypeScript and Vue source patterns for JS-detected projects\n064efdc fix: add JSONC comment stripping in step_04 to prevent tsconfig.json false positives\nfdfb34d fix: filter script references by detected language extension in step_03\ne3311fe fix: relativize docFiles paths before building AI prompt in step_02\nd980e3c fix: use absolute paths in step_02 glob calls to fix silent file read failures\n\n**Diff statistics:**\n745 files changed, 3195 insertions(+), 3652 deletions(-)\n\n**Diff sample (first 80 lines):**\n(diff unavailable)\nBump Type: [major|minor|patch